// 009.4 (D38, #43, #49): `Done(act)`, `?occurred`, `Before`, `Within d Of`, `At`, `Age`, `Overdue`.
Fact person Identified by Helen, Elena, Sam
Role principal Is Helen
Act sign Actor person Holds when person == Helen
Act revoke Actor person Holds when person == Helen
Event death
Bool authority Holds when Done(sign) && !Done(revoke) && !Done(death)

Bool knew-prior
Event hand-over
Bool exempt Holds when knew-prior Before hand-over

Event dismiss
Act sign-release Actor person Holds when True
Bool severance-earned Holds when sign-release(Elena) Within 21 Of dismiss

Bool in-force Holds when Current Time < 100
Event divorce
Bool half-awarded
Power claim-half Actor person
  Valid when (in-force At divorce) && Done(divorce)
  Creates half-awarded

Duty hand-child Holder person Claimant person' Due within 2
.
?!occurred sign(Helen).
?!authority.
+knew-prior.
@ 5.
sign(Helen).
?occurred sign(Helen).
?!occurred revoke(Helen).
?authority.
hand-over().
?exempt.
?(Age(knew-prior) == 5).

// Release signed within 21 days of dismissal:
@ 10.
dismiss().
@ 25.
sign-release(Elena).
?severance-earned.

// Divorce at t=50 (while `in-force` holds!), claimed at t=150 (after `in-force` ended!):
@ 50.
divorce().
@ 150.
?!in-force.
?valid claim-half(Elena).

// Overdue duration on a duty (`Due within 2`): created at 150, at 155 overdue by 3!
+hand-child(Elena, Sam).
@ 155.
?(Overdue(hand-child(Elena, Sam)) == 3).
